{"about_the_game":"<i>Creaking footsteps in vacant rooms... Voices whispering beyond the trees...</i><br><br>Befriend your local wildlife and feed them their favorite snacks in this cozy atmospheric cooking simulator! There's a strange house to search, a forest to explore, and stomachs to fill. Set the radio to play some tunes and get comfy, the witching hour has only begun...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097300/extras/50e5291066c55813de7b8bccb09e6386.avif?t=1759402125\" data-has-big width=800 height=327 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Find and feed creatures</strong> of all shapes and sizes.<br></li><li><strong>Cook up over forty recipes</strong> to suit each critter's tastes. <br></li><li><strong>Explore a mysterious house</strong> and expand your cooking arsenal.<br></li><li><strong>Snap pictures\u00a0</strong>to fill out a photo album. <br></li><li><strong>Vibe to an original soundtrack</strong> complete with an in-game radio.<br></li><li><strong>Get immersed in early 2000s graphics</strong> with a modern flair!<br></li><li><strong>A snack sized game</strong> - <i>Creature Kitchen</i> is about three hours long.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3097300?t=1759402125","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097300/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759402125","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097300/6888477861029e008db73957c8b91e786a6d65c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759402125","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3097300/6888477861029e008db73957c8b91e786a6d65c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759402125","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28